1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Maa... bohot tez bukhaar hai...
kaash aap yahan hoti...

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,400
Mummy... aap itni raat ko
gaon se kaise aayi?

3
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,600
Tujhe bukhaar ho, aur mujhe
pata na chale? Chal, doodh pee le.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Hello? Papa?
Mummy kahan—

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Kabir... beta jaldi gaon aa ja!

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,200
Teri Mummy... raat 12 baje...
heart attack. Woh chali gayi beta.

7
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:46,500
Aakhri saans tak bas tera
naam le rahi thi...
